@startuml activity-add-item-to-cart
' Add item to cart: a guest or a customer puts one coffee in the cart
' from its detail page. The quantity picker stops at the stock, and
' Add to Cart is disabled for a coffee out of stock.

title Add item to cart

|Guest|
|Coffee Shop System|

|Guest|
start
:1 · Open Product detail\n(from Home, Roasts or search);
|Coffee Shop System|
:Load the coffee\n(price and stock of its variant);
if (In stock?) then ([no])
  :Show "Out of stock"\n(Add to Cart disabled);
  stop
else ([yes])
endif
|Guest|
:2 · Choose the quantity\n(from 1 up to the stock);
:3 · Click Add to Cart;
|Coffee Shop System|
if (Already in the cart?) then ([yes])
  :Raise its quantity\n(never above the stock);
else ([no])
  :Add a new line;
endif
:Save the cart\n(device for a guest, shop for a user);
:Show "Added to cart"\n(quantity × coffee name);
:Open the Cart page;
stop

@enduml
